# /agreement system kill switch (deployed 2026-04-28)
#
# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback intercepts /contract?token=... before
# Worker routes fire. These rules proxy /contract and /payment to the
# Worker (status 200, transparent rewrite) so the Worker can own the
# kill-switch routing decision.
#
# DO NOT change to "/contract -> /agreement" 301s -- that bypasses the
# Worker entirely and locks the kill switch open.
# DO NOT remove without first updating wrangler.toml routes and Worker
# handlers. See: src/agreement.ts and src/index.ts in iris-automation
# for the routing logic these rules forward to.
/contract     https://iris-automation.flyin-iris-mp.workers.dev/contract  200
/contract/*   https://iris-automation.flyin-iris-mp.workers.dev/contract  200
/payment      https://iris-automation.flyin-iris-mp.workers.dev/payment   200
/payment/*    https://iris-automation.flyin-iris-mp.workers.dev/payment   200
